Subject: [PATCH 1/5] gpui: An Android platform (gpui_android)

A GPUI platform for Android on android-activity's NativeActivity: the wgpu renderer
(Vulkan, or GLES), touch and hardware-keyboard input, the soft keyboard through an
InputConnection, the system clipboard, window insets and Back. gpui, gpui_platform and
gpui_wgpu learn the android target.
